'''Shiny''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from the [[Rainbow Box]] or through trading.
== Appearance==
The whole knife is colored with a shiny rainbow texture, hence the name.

==Trivia==
*The [https://www.roblox.com/library/319971762/MLG2 texture] made for Shiny when the [[Chroma Box]] was released was designed by [[ArcticMage]], and was uploaded to Roblox on November 14, 2015.
*It is the only item, along with [[Heat]], to have not been replaced or removed when the [[Chroma Box]] was removed and replaced with the [[Rainbow Box]]. Instead, it was simply retextured.
*It replaced the knife [[MLG]] due to copyright reasons.

